ena.sase-qd.1/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-qd.1","local_name":"sase-qd.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-qd","agent_clan_generation":"20260818181523","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-qd.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-qd[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Show and set the current project from the Admin Center Projects tab[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]The Projects tab of the SASE Admin Center says which project is [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]current — in the project's own accent color, the same one the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]top-bar `+<project>` chip uses — and one configurable keypress on [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]any row makes that project current, everywhere, at once.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]projects_tab_current_project.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/projects_tab_current_project.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-qd[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-qd/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]A verified write path for the current project[/bold #D7AFFF]                 [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-set[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-set: add `set_current_project()` to `sase.current_project` — [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]eligibility check, provider-exact MRU prefix, single MRU promotion, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]post-write re-resolve — returning a typed outcome, and land `sase [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]project set-current <project>` as its first real consumer.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Render the current project in the Projects sub-tab[/bold #D7AFFF]            [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]pane-display[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]pane-display: give ProjectsPane a reusable off-thread current-project [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]resolve (replacing the seed-only worker), cache it in session state, and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]render it as a `CUR` column marker plus accent-colored name, a `current:[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]+<name>` segment in the summary line, and a `Current project:` block in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the detail panel.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Make every Projects-tab key configurable[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]keymap-scope[dim] · [dim][/dim]after pane-display[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]keymap-scope: add the `ace.keymaps.projects` scope covering all three [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Projects-tab sub-tabs, following the statistics/glossary pattern [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF](dataclass, defaults, schema, loader, binding builder, registry field, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pane wiring), and render the hints line from the configured keys instead[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of hardcoded letters.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The set-current keypress[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]set-action[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-set, keymap-scope[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]set-action: bind `set_current_project` (default `c`) in the Projects [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sub-tab, run core-set's write on a thread worker with cheap in-memory [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pre-checks, report every outcome honestly in the status line and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]notification, and refresh the top-bar chip immediately instead of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]waiting out its poll.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation and visual proof[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs-visual[dim] · [dim][/dim]after set-action[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs-visual: rewrite the \"Current project\" and \"Projects Tab\" sections [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]of docs/ace.md, document the new keymap scope in docs/configuration.md, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]add a PNG golden that shows the current-project row and detail block, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and run the full verification lane.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-qd","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-qd.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ff035d8b761b51798a26873f81a67db6","started_at":"2026-08-18T22:15:47.742983+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-qd","bbugyi200.athena.sase-qd.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-qd.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-qd.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-qd.4","bbugyi200.athena.sase-qd.5","bbugyi200.athena.sase-qd.land"]}
